1
00:00:03,900 --> 00:00:10,354
Why can a price move of just RM1 make a RM25 difference to one FCPO contract?

2
00:00:11,094 --> 00:00:14,068
It all comes down to the contract specifications.

3
00:00:15,968 --> 00:00:22,350
In this video, we read the FCPO contract specifications, and what each number means for a trader.

4
00:00:25,050 --> 00:00:32,968
FCPO, or Crude Palm Oil Futures, is a futures contract on crude palm oil, traded on Bursa Malaysia Derivatives.

5
00:00:33,308 --> 00:00:42,114
Malaysia is one of the world's largest palm oil producers, so the industry needs a transparent local market to price and hedge crude palm oil.

6
00:00:42,454 --> 00:00:51,716
Follow the journey: from the plantation, to the mill, to crude palm oil, to a standardised futures contract, and finally to the trading screen.

7
00:00:53,616 --> 00:00:57,118
Here is the core of the FCPO specification sheet.

8
00:00:57,458 --> 00:01:06,000
The contract code is FCPO, the underlying asset is crude palm oil, and one contract represents 25 metric tonnes.

9
00:01:06,340 --> 00:01:15,914
Prices are quoted in Ringgit per metric tonne. The minimum price fluctuation is RM1 per tonne, so the tick value is RM25 per contract.

10
00:01:16,254 --> 00:01:19,012
And the settlement method is physical delivery.

11
00:01:21,112 --> 00:01:27,614
Twenty-five metric tonnes is twenty-five thousand kilograms of crude palm oil, in a single contract.

12
00:01:27,954 --> 00:01:36,544
Every price on the screen is per tonne, but your exposure is always for the full 25 tonnes, multiplied by the number of contracts.

13
00:01:38,644 --> 00:01:43,322
The smallest price change allowed is RM1 per tonne. This is called a tick.

14
00:01:43,662 --> 00:01:50,020
Because one contract is 25 tonnes, one tick is worth RM25 per contract.

15
00:01:50,360 --> 00:02:02,526
So a RM10 move is RM250. A RM20 move is RM500. And a RM50 move is RM1,250, for every contract, up or down.

16
00:02:04,626 --> 00:02:16,936
Now contract value. At RM4,000 per tonne, one contract is worth RM4,000 times 25, or RM100,000.

17
00:02:17,276 --> 00:02:27,954
Contract value is not the same as the margin needed to open a position. Margin is only a portion of it, set by clearing house requirements and your broker, and it can change.

18
00:02:30,054 --> 00:02:34,588
FCPO is a physically delivered contract. It is not cash-settled.

19
00:02:34,928 --> 00:02:48,894
If a position is carried into the delivery process, the exchange's delivery obligations and procedures apply. Sellers must deliver crude palm oil that meets the contract standards, and buyers must take delivery and pay for it.

20
00:02:49,234 --> 00:02:57,992
That is why retail traders generally close their positions before delivery-related obligations become relevant, subject to their broker's policies.

21
00:03:00,092 --> 00:03:05,082
Why does all of this matter? Because the specifications tell you exactly what you are trading.

22
00:03:05,422 --> 00:03:11,396
How much each tick is worth, how large your exposure is, and what obligations come with the contract.

23
00:03:13,496 --> 00:03:18,270
FCPO is the crude palm oil futures contract traded on BMD.

24
00:03:18,610 --> 00:03:23,096
One contract is 25 metric tonnes, priced in Ringgit per tonne.

25
00:03:23,436 --> 00:03:28,282
One tick is RM1 per tonne, worth RM25 per contract.

26
00:03:28,622 --> 00:03:32,868
Contract value is price times 25, and it is not the margin.

27
00:03:33,208 --> 00:03:38,870
FCPO is physically delivered, with real obligations for positions held into delivery.

28
00:03:39,210 --> 00:03:42,088
Always check the latest official specifications.

29
00:03:43,388 --> 00:03:52,266
Before trading FCPO, know what you are trading. Understand the contract size, the tick value and the responsibilities of every contract.

30
00:03:54,366 --> 00:03:58,132
This is only the foundation for understanding the futures market.

31
00:03:58,472 --> 00:04:01,470
Know the product you trade before taking any risk.

32
00:04:01,810 --> 00:04:04,880
Continue your learning with Capital Market Institute.

33
00:04:06,780 --> 00:04:12,442
The references for this video are shown on screen. Always check the latest official specifications.

34
